      "seed": 925422277,
      "version": 833,
      "versionNonce": 784555760,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790382186814,
      "created": 1790381678168,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements: \n\nQ1: What is the capacity of the fleet (personal vls companies) - scale from 1m to 3 years project\nR1 - 10^6m users\n\nQ2: How are we vending tokens in the lab or small fleet (GPUs / Models) so i can visualize the system\nNA\n\nQ3: Do we have contractual agreements on SLA - P99 for uptime / latency on request\n5ms P99 (proposed; uptime P99\n\nQ4: Do we have compliance on regional criteria ? What can vend there? \nSkip\n\nQ5: Any requirements on Dashboard\n\nQ6: What is the billing model? \nNA\n\nQ7: ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements: \n\nQ1: What is the capacity of the fleet (personal vls companies) - scale from 1m to 3 years project\nR1 - 10^6m users\n\nQ2: How are we vending tokens in the lab or small fleet (GPUs / Models) so i can visualize the system\nNA\n\nQ3: Do we have contractual agreements on SLA - P99 for uptime / latency on request\n5ms P99 (proposed; uptime P99\n\nQ4: Do we have compliance on regional criteria ? What can vend there? \nSkip\n\nQ5: Any requirements on Dashboard\n\nQ6: What is the billing model? \nNA\n\nQ7: ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
